ntains the saved movement and the item with updated stock values\",\n      \"when\": \"it sends POST /api/inventory/movements\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A client submits an inventory request that fails the contract validation rules\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-6.5\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"the response status is 422 and the response error code is VALIDATION_ERROR\",\n      \"when\": \"it sends the applicable inventory write request\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"Where the locked OpenAPI contract defines inventory operations, the Feedlot API shall provide inventory reads, item creation and updates, and receipt or adjustment recording with the declared stock values.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-6\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-1\",\n     \"Q-1\"\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-7.1\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"each response status is 200 and each response contains the requested horizon, projection rows, and movement distinctions\",\n      \"when\": \"it requests GET /api/inventory/projections separately with horizon=daily, weekly, monthly, quarterly, semiAnnual, and annual\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-7.2\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"the response status is 200 and the response contains fileName, contentType text/csv, and a Base64 CSV content field\",\n      \"when\": \"it sends GET /api/inventory/export\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and supplies a horizon outside the contract enum\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-7.3\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"the response status is 422 and the response error code is VALIDATION_ERROR\",\n      \"when\": \"it sends GET /api/inventory/projections\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"Where the locked OpenAPI contract defines inventory projections and export, the Feedlot API shall return wastage-adjusted projections for each declared horizon and an inventory CSV artifact.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-7\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-1\",\n     \"Q-1\"\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-8.1\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"the response status is 200 and the response rations list contains saved ration definitions and their ingredient and cost fields\",\n      \"when\": \"it sends GET /api/rations\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and submits a valid RationRequest\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-8.2\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"the response status is 201 and the response ration contains the saved definition and calculated costPerPound\",\n      \"when\": \"it sends POST /api/rations\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token, an existing ration, and a valid RationRequest\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-8.3\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"the response status is 200 and the response ration contains the revised definition\",\n      \"when\": \"it sends PATCH /api/rations/{rationId}\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and submits a valid ration optimization request\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-8.4\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"the response status is 200 and the response contains the contract optimization result and cost comparison fields\",\n      \"when\": \"it sends POST /api/rations/optimization\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and the requested ration exists in a state eligible for approval\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-8.5\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"the response status is 200 and the response contains the rationId and updated approvalStatus fields\",\n      \"when\": \"it sends POST /api/rations/{rationId}/approval\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"Where the locked OpenAPI contract defines ration operations, the Feedlot API shall provide ration reads, creation, revision, optimization, and approval with the declared response behavior.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-8\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-1\",\n     \"Q-1\"\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-9.1\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"the response status is 200 and the response plans list contains saved plan and audit-history fields\",\n      \"when\": \"it sends GET /api/feed-plans\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and submits a valid FeedPlanRequest\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-9.2\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"the response status is 201 and the response plan contains calculated planned quantity, cost, energy, and status fields\",\n      \"when\": \"it sends POST /api/feed-plans\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token, an existing plan, and a valid PlanReviewRequest\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-9.3\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"the response status is 200 and the response plan contains the resulting reviewRequired and plan values\",\n      \"when\": \"it sends POST /api/feed-plans/{planId}/review\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token, an existing plan, and a valid PlanStatusRequest\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-9.4\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"the response status is 200 and the response plan contains the saved execution status\",\n      \"when\": \"it sends PATCH /api/feed-plans/{planId}/status\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"Where the locked OpenAPI contract defines feed-plan operations, the Feedlot API shall provide plan reads and creation, review handling, and execution-status updates with the declared calculated and saved values.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-9\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-1\",\n     \"Q-1\"\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-10.1\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"the response status is 200 and the response events list contains feeding activity and lot allocation fields\",\n      \"when\": \"it sends GET /api/feeding-events\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and submits a valid FeedingEventRequest\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-10.2\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"the response status is 201 and the response contains the saved event, calculated variance and cost, inventoryMovements, and updated lotFeedTotals\",\n      \"when\": \"it sends POST /api/feeding-events\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token, an existing feeding event, and a valid FeedingEventRequest\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-10.3\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"the response status is 200 and the response contains the corrected event, resulting inventory movement, and recalculated lotFeedTotals\",\n      \"when\": \"it sends PATCH /api/feeding-events/{eventId}\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and an existing feeding event that can be voided\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-10.4\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"the response status is 200 and the response event has Voided status with a reversal movement and recalculated lotFeedTotals\",\n      \"when\": \"it sends POST /api/feeding-events/{eventId}/void\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A client submits a feeding event that conflicts with current inventory or fails the contract validation rules\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-10.5\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"the response status is 409 or 422 as declared for the conflict or validation condition and the response contains the contract ApiError fields\",\n      \"when\": \"it sends POST /api/feeding-events\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"Where the locked OpenAPI contract defines feeding-event operations, the Feedlot API shall provide event reads, recording, correction, and voiding with corresponding inventory movements and lot feed totals.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-10\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-1\",\n     \"Q-1\"\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and supplies any supported penId, lotId, from, or to filters\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-11.1\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"the response status is 200 and the response contains permission-filtered feedingRows, performanceRows, inventoryRows, and summary fields matching the filters\",\n      \"when\": \"it sends GET /api/reports/operational\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and supplies the same supported filters\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-11.2\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"the response status is 200 and the response contains a CSV file artifact containing only the filtered authorized rows\",\n      \"when\": \"it sends GET /api/reports/operational/export\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"Where the locked OpenAPI contract defines operational report operations, the Feedlot API shall return filtered operational rows and summary values and export the filtered authorized rows as CSV.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-11\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-1\",\n     \"Q-1\"\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and supplies required from and to dates plus any supported breed, sex, or penId filters\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-12.1\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"the response status is 200 and the response rows contain the contract ADG, feed, FCR, cost-of-gain, and energy fields for matching lots\",\n      \"when\": \"it sends GET /api/reports/feed-to-gain\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and supplies required dates, supported filters, and format=csv or format=pdf\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-12.2\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"the response status is 200 and the response contains a file artifact whose contentType and content correspond to the requested format and filtered authorized rows\",\n      \"when\": \"it sends GET /api/reports/feed-to-gain/export\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A client omits a required date or supplies an export format outside the contract enum\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-12.3\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"the response status is 422 and the response error code is VALIDATION_ERROR\",\n      \"when\": \"it sends a feed-to-gain report or export request\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"Where the locked OpenAPI contract defines feed-to-gain report operations, the Feedlot API shall return metrics calculated from records in the selected date range and export filtered results in the requested format.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-12\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-1\",\n     \"Q-1\"\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and supplies any supported horizon, breed, penId, or roiStatus filters\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-13.1\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"the response status is 200 and the response contains the authorized rows and canViewProfitability field declared by the contract\",\n      \"when\": \"it sends GET /api/reports/profitability\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and supplies the supported profitability filters\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-13.2\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"the response status is 200 and the response co